<div class="accordion">
  <details name="faq" open>
    <summary>What is vanillapod?</summary>
    <p>A collection of vanilla web components and DOM utilities.</p>
  </details>
  <details name="faq">
    <summary>Does it need a framework?</summary>
    <p>No, it only uses platform features.</p>
  </details>
</div>
